{"version":1,"content":"<p>在美國商務部將阿里巴巴旗下新加坡子公司Apex Enterprise Solutions列入實體清單後，阿里巴巴發言人明確回應：「將Apex Enterprise Solutions列入實體清單是錯誤的。Apex從未轉移任何受美國出口管制的先進計算晶片。我們將通過一切法律途徑，維護公司的合法權益和聲譽。」</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587804.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:04:08.410181+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:37:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:12.446417+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:12.446417+00:00","content_hash":"77fb1669335cb8d0d6b9f087d66e647b9b12df3c9fc598f422bfe7aa18740b4d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}